<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/msa@/~cl_25> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "25" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/msa@> .
